Z||000009||Monkeyman||02-04-2000||03:56 AM||||I agree but I just have 2 things to add.  1st--sometimes it's  more important to have a larger, more detailed pic. And 2nd--Sometimes even an 800x600 size is still too big.  I don't know what the right size is, but I don't mind going back and correcting a pic or two, once in a while, but if I don't get it right the 2nd time, I give up.  It doesn't take long to resize a pic, but it's not instantaneous, either.||||reg||1
